msgstr "No detailed results available."

msgid "No engines detected this file as malicious."
msgstr "No engines detected this file as malicious."

msgid "Checks the focused file with VirusTotal using its SHA-256 hash or by uploading it, and allows checking URLs/Hashes manually.  How to get an API Key: 1. Register a free account at virustotal.com. 2. Go to your Profile -> API Key and copy your key. 3. Open NVDA Settings -> VirusTotal and paste the key.  How to set Hotkeys (None by default): 1. Go to NVDA Menu -> Preferences -> Input Gestures. 2. Expand the 'VirusTotal' category. 3. Assign your preferred shortcuts for checking a file and opening the manual check dialog. Features Multi-language support (English, Russian, Uzbek)."
msgstr "Checks the focused file with VirusTotal using its SHA-256 hash or by uploading it, and allows checking URLs/Hashes manually.  How to get an API Key: 1. Register a free account at virustotal.com. 2. Go to your Profile -> API Key and copy your key. 3. Open NVDA Settings -> VirusTotal and paste the key.  How to set Hotkeys (None by default): 1. Go to NVDA Menu -> Preferences -> Input Gestures. 2. Expand the 'VirusTotal' category. 3. Assign your preferred shortcuts for checking a file and opening the manual check dialog. Features Multi-language support (English, Russian, Uzbek)."

